+## 6. From GitHub instead of the dashboard
+
+`forge0-ci --repo <checkout> --test "<failing test>" --dry-run` runs the same investigation
+headlessly and prints the git/gh commands it would run: a branch, a commit by `forge0[bot]`, and
+`gh pr create` with the evidence as the description. Without `--dry-run`, and in the workflow from
+[integrations/github](../integrations/github/README.md), it opens the PR for real.
